<title>CHILE: Spain's Endesa confirms Chile talks.</title>
<headline>Spain's Endesa confirms Chile talks.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish power utility Endesa on Wednesday said it was in talks with major shareholders of the Chispa group of investment firms, which are linked with Chile's Enersis electricity holding company.</p>
<p>&quot;Endesa is holding talks with significant shareholders in the Chispa companies,&quot; the company, formally named Empresa Nacional de Electricidad SA, said in a statement released in Santiago.</p>
</text>
